  "text": "You have the hindquarters of a cricket and shiny skin that appears chitinous, though it might be soft to the touch. You adore art and music. Your cricket legs grant you a +2 circumstance bonus to Athletics checks to high-jump or long-jump. You also gain Figment as a primal innate cantrip, though you can use it only to create illusory sounds, not visions. A cantrip is heightened to a spell rank equal to half your level rounded up.",
